{"unit_id":"TwinsEarth__DSH-2Xray#feature-1","repo":"TwinsEarth/DSH-2Xray","commit":"5b984e54bab67b3fa5aecd2c94d6e8cc0172d5e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-2Xray 的功能「代理流量接管」：启动并探测 Xray 本地入站后，将 DSH 进程的 HTTP(S) 请求路由到该入站。接入在插件启动流程中自动进行，并由监督器管理。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:288-326","lib/supervisor.js:47-61"]}
{"unit_id":"TwinsEarth__DSH-2Xray#feature-2","repo":"TwinsEarth/DSH-2Xray","commit":"5b984e54bab67b3fa5aecd2c94d6e8cc0172d5e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-2Xray 的功能「多节点切换」：可将配置的多个节点作为出站线路，并通过工具指定节点 ID 或出站标签切换当前线路，无需重启代理进程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:57-76"]}
